          <p>Specs, roadmaps, user research synthesis, stakeholder updates, competitive landscape.</p>
          <span class="catalog-card-author">Anthropic</span>
        </article>

        <article class="catalog-card">
          <div class="catalog-card-meta">
            <span class="catalog-card-prefix">/customer-support:*</span>
            <span class="catalog-card-tag">5 workflows</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Customer Support</h3>
          <p>Triage, draft responses, escalate, research context, build the knowledge base.</p>
          <span class="catalog-card-author">Anthropic</span>
        </article>

        <article class="catalog-card">
          <div class="catalog-card-meta">
            <span class="catalog-card-prefix">/operations:*</span>
            <span class="catalog-card-tag">9 workflows</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Operations</h3>
          <p>Vendor management, process docs, change management, capacity planning, compliance.</p>
